.TH "sminspector" "1" "2026-01-06" "1.0.0-beta2" "SpectMorph Manual"
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
sminspector - program to visualize contents of SpectMorph instruments
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]sminspector\f[R] \f[I][OPTIONS]\f[R] \f[I]SMIndex-File\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
sminspector is a gui application which can be used to visualize
SpectMorph models.
An input file with containing a list of instruments to open should be
passed as first argument.
This file is a text file, consisting of the commands listed below, and
specifies a set of instruments to work with.
.SH INDEX FILE COMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]smset_dir\f[R] \[dq]\f[I]directory\f[R]\[dq]
Set directory which contains the smset files.
.TP
\f[B]smset\f[R] \[dq]\f[I]instrument.smset\f[R]\[dq]
Add smset-instrument.
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
smenc.1, smvisualize.1
